<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Anything Goes</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Sick Joy</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">More Forever</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">276X7RT7K9HHDOg0KIhud2</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.258" end="00:12.426">Let my brain breathe in the midnight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.426" end="00:16.607">Let my footprints pick my next fight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.607" end="00:18.151">How’d I get here?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.151" end="00:19.724">Watch me disappear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.724" end="00:22.034">I guess I'm not</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.034" end="00:24.967">Alright</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.967" end="00:29.106">Bleaching my veins and my halo</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.106" end="00:32.338">Keep it all up or let it all go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.338" end="00:36.367">I could do anything I want</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.367" end="00:38.696">If I wanted it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.696" end="00:41.687" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.687" end="00:45.658">Cut me down or love me deep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.658" end="00:48.176">Just give me a scar I can keep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.176" end="00:49.676" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.226" end="00:52.264">I need a reason to change</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.264" end="00:56.602">I keep believing I can stay the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.602" end="01:00.752">I feel me falling away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.752" end="01:04.793">I need to find a way to start again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.793" end="01:06.773" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.773" end="01:10.906">Running around in a dead night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.906" end="01:15.016">Hiding my face from the daylight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.016" end="01:16.661">Everyone knows</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.661" end="01:18.261">Anything goes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.261" end="01:23.451">When I'm not, not alright</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.451" end="01:27.444">Dragging this around like a millstone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.444" end="01:31.810">I cut off the limb still feel it though</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.810" end="01:33.310">We still could try</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.274" end="01:34.774">Maybe I could try</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.757" end="01:37.103">One more time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.103" end="01:38.713">This lie</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.713" end="01:40.213" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.077" end="01:44.013">Cut me down or love me deep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.013" end="01:46.597">Just give me a scar I can keep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.597" end="01:48.097" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.647" end="01:50.717">I need a reason to change</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.717" end="01:55.005">I keep believing I can stay the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.005" end="01:59.112">I feel me falling away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.112" end="02:03.192">I need to find a way to start again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.192" end="02:07.495">I need a reason to change</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.495" end="02:11.593">I keep believing I can stay the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.593" end="02:13.697" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.697" end="02:15.667">If I can use it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.667" end="02:17.790">I will abuse it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.790" end="02:19.889">If I can use it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.889" end="02:22.080">I will abuse it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.080" end="02:24.104">If I can use it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.104" end="02:26.144">I will abuse it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.144" end="02:28.263">If I can use it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.263" end="02:30.255">I will abuse it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.255" end="02:31.755" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.422" end="02:32.325">If I can use it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.325" end="02:34.449">I will abuse it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.449" end="02:36.513">If I can use it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.513" end="02:38.688">I will abuse it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.688" end="02:40.694">If I can use it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.694" end="02:42.694">I will abuse it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.694" end="02:44.851">If I can use it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.851" end="02:46.351" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.901" end="02:49.089">I need a reason to change</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.089" end="02:53.262">I keep believing I can stay the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.262" end="02:57.480">I feel me falling away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.480" end="03:01.561">I need to find a way to start again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.561" end="03:05.836">I need a reason to change</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:05.836" end="03:09.988">I keep believing I can stay the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:09.988" end="03:14.230">I feel me falling away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:14.230" end="03:18.230">I need to find a way to start again</p></div></body></tt>